## 커스텀 프로퍼티 위임 구현

### 실무 예제: TTL 캐싱 위임

```kotlin
class CachedProperty<T>(
    private val ttlMillis: Long,
    private val loader: () -> T
) : ReadOnlyProperty<Any?, T> {

    private var cachedValue: T? = null
    private var lastLoadTime: Long = 0

    override fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty<*>): T {
        val now = System.currentTimeMillis()
        if (cachedValue == null || now - lastLoadTime > ttlMillis) {
            cachedValue = loader()
            lastLoadTime = now
        }
        return cachedValue!!
    }
}

// 편의 함수
fun <T> cached(ttlMillis: Long, loader: () -> T) = CachedProperty(ttlMillis, loader)

// 사용
class FeatureFlagService(private val client: ConfigClient) {
    // 5분마다 갱신
    val flags: Map<String, Boolean> by cached(ttlMillis = 300_000) {
        client.loadFeatureFlags()
    }
}
```

### 실무 예제: Spring Environment 위임

