## Contracts (실험적)

### 스마트 캐스트 개선

```kotlin
@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)
fun String?.isNotNullOrEmpty(): Boolean {
    contract {
        returns(true) implies (this@isNotNullOrEmpty != null)
    }
    return this != null && this.isNotEmpty()
}

fun process(name: String?) {
    if (name.isNotNullOrEmpty()) {
        // contract 덕분에 name이 String으로 스마트 캐스트됨
        println(name.length)  // ✅ null 체크 없이 사용 가능
    }
}
```

### `callsInPlace` 계약

```kotlin
@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)
inline fun <T> executeOnce(block: () -> T): T {
    contract {
        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)
    }
    return block()
}

fun demo() {
    val value: Int
    executeOnce {
        value = 42  // ✅ 컴파일러가 정확히 한 번 호출됨을 알고 있어 val 초기화 허용
    }
    println(value)  // ✅ 초기화 보장
}
```

> [!warning] Contracts의 현재 상태
> Contracts는 아직 **실험적(Experimental)** API이다. `@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)`가 필요하며, 향후 API가 변경될 수 있다. 하지만 표준 라이브러리의 `require`, `check`, `run`, `let` 등에서 이미 내부적으로 활용되고 있다.

---

## Sealed Class/Interface 활용 패턴

### `sealed class` vs `sealed interface`

```kotlin
// sealed class: 상태 + 동작을 함께 가질 때
sealed class PaymentState {
    abstract val orderId: Long

    data class Pending(override val orderId: Long) : PaymentState()
    data class Processing(override val orderId: Long, val transactionId: String) : PaymentState()
    data class Completed(override val orderId: Long, val amount: Money) : PaymentState()
    data class Failed(override val orderId: Long, val reason: String) : PaymentState()
}

// sealed interface: 다중 구현이 필요할 때 (Kotlin 1.5+)
sealed interface DomainError
sealed interface PaymentError : DomainError {
    data class InsufficientBalance(val required: Money) : PaymentError
    data class CardDeclined(val reason: String) : PaymentError
    data class Timeout(val duration: Duration) : PaymentError
}
sealed interface OrderError : DomainError {
    data class OutOfStock(val productId: ProductId) : OrderError
    data class InvalidAddress(val detail: String) : OrderError
}
```

### `when` 표현식의 exhaustive 검사

```kotlin
fun handlePayment(state: PaymentState): String = when (state) {
    is PaymentState.Pending -> "결제 대기 중"
    is PaymentState.Processing -> "처리 중: ${state.transactionId}"
    is PaymentState.Completed -> "완료: ${state.amount.toWon()}"
    is PaymentState.Failed -> "실패: ${state.reason}"
    // 모든 케이스를 처리해야 컴파일 통과 (exhaustive)
    // 새로운 상태가 추가되면 컴파일 에러로 누락 방지
}
```

### 상태 머신 패턴

```kotlin
sealed class OrderState {
    data object Created : OrderState()
    data class Paid(val paymentId: String) : OrderState()
    data class Shipped(val trackingNumber: String) : OrderState()
    data class Delivered(val deliveredAt: Instant) : OrderState()
    data class Cancelled(val reason: String) : OrderState()

    // 상태 전이 규칙을 타입으로 강제
    fun canTransitionTo(next: OrderState): Boolean = when (this) {
        is Created -> next is Paid || next is Cancelled
        is Paid -> next is Shipped || next is Cancelled
        is Shipped -> next is Delivered
        is Delivered -> false  // 최종 상태
        is Cancelled -> false  // 최종 상태
    }
}
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Paid: 결제
    Created --> Cancelled: 취소
    Paid --> Shipped: 배송
    Paid --> Cancelled: 환불
    Shipped --> Delivered: 수령
    Delivered --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
```

### 에러 핸들링 패턴: sealed class Result

```kotlin
sealed interface OrderResult {
    data class Success(val order: Order) : OrderResult
    data class StockError(val productId: ProductId) : OrderResult
    data class PaymentError(val reason: String) : OrderResult
    data class ValidationError(val errors: List<String>) : OrderResult
}

// 서비스에서 사용
fun createOrder(request: OrderRequest): OrderResult {
    // 유효성 검증
    val errors = validate(request)
    if (errors.isNotEmpty()) return OrderResult.ValidationError(errors)

    // 재고 확인
    val stockResult = checkStock(request.items)
    if (stockResult is StockCheckResult.OutOfStock) {
        return OrderResult.StockError(stockResult.productId)
    }

    // 결제 처리
    return when (val payment = processPayment(request)) {
        is PaymentResult.Success -> OrderResult.Success(Order.from(request, payment))
        is PaymentResult.Failure -> OrderResult.PaymentError(payment.reason)
    }
}

// 컨트롤러에서 사용
@PostMapping("/orders")
fun createOrder(@RequestBody request: OrderRequest): ResponseEntity<*> {
    return when (val result = orderService.createOrder(request)) {
        is OrderResult.Success -> ResponseEntity.ok(result.order.toDto())
        is OrderResult.StockError -> ResponseEntity.badRequest().body("재고 부족: ${result.productId}")
        is OrderResult.PaymentError -> ResponseEntity.badRequest().body("결제 실패: ${result.reason}")
        is OrderResult.ValidationError -> ResponseEntity.badRequest().body(result.errors)
    }
}
```

